<title>JAPAN: Komatsu Wall - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Komatsu Wall - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  9.86		vs	    9.09</p>
<p> Operating	    1.07		vs	  870    mln</p>
<p> Current		1.13		vs	  903    mln</p>
<p> Net		  586    mln	  vs	  471    mln</p>
<p> EPS		   53.83 yen	  vs	   43.21 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     11 million	  vs	  11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Komatsu Wall Industry Co Ltd manufactures and sells aluminium movable partitions.</p>
